35:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["The ",["$","code",null,{"children":"MULTI_WORKER.md"}]," advice to share a CAS volume is not what the shipped\nconfig does."]}]," That document tells you all workers must mount the same\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"cas-data"}]," volume and share a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"content_path"}],". The worker config next to it does\nnot do that. It uses a worker-local filesystem tier over a ",["$","code",null,{"children":"grpc"}]," store, which\nis the correct design, and it writes to a path the shared volume does not even\ncover. Workers share the CAS by talking to the CAS server. A shared filesystem\nbetween workers is neither required nor sufficient, and on anything other than\none host it is not available."]}]
