3a:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"The healthchecks in the compose file probe a path that isn't served."}]," Both\nservices healthcheck ",["$","code",null,{"children":"http://localhost:PORT/status"}],", but ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/status"}]," only exists\nwhen that server's ",["$","code",null,{"children":"services"}]," block includes ",["$","code",null,{"children":"health"}],". Neither the CAS config\nnor the scheduler's client-facing listener has one. Add ",["$","code",null,{"children":"health: {}"}]," to the\nservices on the port you're probing, or drop the healthcheck."]}]
