72:["$","$L70",null,{"title":"Can workers run on different architectures?","id":"can-workers-run-on-different-architectures","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["Yes, and this is what ",["$","code",null,{"children":"ISA"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"OSFamily"}]," are for. Advertise the real values\non each worker and set ",["$","code",null,{"children":"ISA"}]," to ",["$","code",null,{"children":"exact"}]," on the scheduler, so an action built\nfor ",["$","code",null,{"children":"x86-64"}]," never lands on an ",["$","code",null,{"children":"aarch64"}]," worker. A pool of mixed architectures\nwith everything advertising the same values is a way to get silent, confusing\nbuild failures."]}]}]
